OL,8,G0306 Outlook
OL,9,     FGrowing up gay in Jamaica,
OL,10,     Fnovelist Marlon James tried to
OL,11,     Fsuppress his sexuality. Now his
OL,12,     Fnew book is about the Jamaican
OL,13,     Funderground gay scene he never
OL,14,     Fexperienced.
OL,15,G0350 Witness History
